# Advanced 9-ball two-rail kick: clear the blockers, hit the legal 5, and pocket it in the side.
# Instructional source: https://drdavepoolinfo.com/tutorial/bank-kick/
# Validation contract: cue contacts right then top cushion, contacts 5 first, pockets 5 center-left, and never contacts a blocker.
table brunswick_gc4_9ft
game nine_ball
ball cue at center
ball five at (0.8500, 4.2500)
ball six at (1.5500, 4.1000)
ball eight at (1.5500, 3.8500)
cue_strike(default).mass_ratio(1.0).energy_loss(0.1)
trace(max_events: 30)
shot(cue).heading(33deg).speed(120ips).tip(side: 0.0R, height: 0.0R).using(default)
